BT 0.42 0.45 0.44 rg /F1 7 Tf 525.1 30 Td (Page 2) Tj ET
BT 0.05 0.36 0.27 rg /F2 11 Tf 48 771.89 Td ("How do you calm things down before they escalate?") Tj ET
BT 0.1 0.12 0.11 rg /F1 10 Tf 58 753.89 Td (What works for the children you know: the early signs, the distractions, the space, the words. A real example) Tj ET
BT 0.1 0.12 0.11 rg /F1 10 Tf 58 739.89 Td (beats the policy.) Tj ET
BT 0.05 0.36 0.27 rg /F2 11 Tf 48 714.89 Td (What inspectors also watch) Tj ET
BT 0.1 0.12 0.11 rg /F1 10 Tf 48 696.89 Td (Handover between shifts. How adults speak to children, and whether children come to them. Whether the daily) Tj ET
BT 0.1 0.12 0.11 rg /F1 10 Tf 48 682.39 Td (logs say what staff say. Whether agency staff know the same answers as permanent staff. Whether the) Tj ET
BT 0.1 0.12 0.11 rg /F1 10 Tf 48 667.89 Td (manager's answers and the team's answers match.) Tj ET
BT 0.1 0.12 0.11 rg /F2 10 Tf 48 648.39 Td (The best preparation is a Tuesday habit, not a briefing: a team meeting where each of these is asked out) Tj ET
BT 0.1 0.12 0.11 rg /F2 10 Tf 48 633.89 Td (loud, once a quarter, and the gaps get fixed.) Tj ET
